Subject: [PATCH 2932/3799] soh: rename func_80B40C50 -> EnXc_NextAfterAction65

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 65 to 66
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index 6c6dcac8d..1d85a0787 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1997,7 +1997,8 @@ void func_80B40BB4(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->actor.shape.shadowAlpha = 255;
 }
 
-void func_80B40C50(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40C50: the same guard from action 65 to 66
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction65(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_65, SHEIK_ACTION_66);
 }
 
@@ -2170,7 +2171,7 @@ void EnXc_KneelInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 void EnXc_ActionFunc65(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ActionFunc6(this, play);
     EnXc_SetPosRotFromCue(this, play, 4);  // was func_80B3C588 [LLM:HIGH]
-    func_80B40C50(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction65(this);  // was func_80B40C50 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc66(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
